---
layout: base.njk
title: Independent TV & Film Content Studio
description: "Stolen Tribe is an independent TV and film content studio amplifying stories across the Black diaspora. Original film, television, animation and branded content. Jersey City. Stories everywhere."
home: true
---
<section class="hero section-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-kicker"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> TV & film content studio</span><span>Rooted in culture. Built for the world.</span><span class="hero-coordinate">40°43′ N / 74°04′ W</span></div>
  <h1 class="hero-wordmark" id="hero-title">STOLEN TRIBE<span class="hero-star" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "asterisk" %}</span><span class="sr-only"> — Independent TV & film content studio</span></h1>
  <div class="hero-film" data-hero-film>
    <img class="hero-image" src="{{ site.hero.image | asset }}" alt="{{ site.hero.alt }}" width="2000" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    {% if site.hero.video %}<video class="hero-video" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="{{ site.hero.image | asset }}"><source src="{{ site.hero.video | asset }}" type="video/mp4"></video><button class="motion-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Pause background video"><span class="motion-label">Pause motion</span> {% icon "pause" %}</button>{% endif %}
    <div class="film-corner corner-tl" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="film-corner corner-tr" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="film-corner corner-bl" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="film-corner corner-br" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="film-topline"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> A different point of view.</span><span>ST / FRAME 001</span></div>
    <div class="hero-film-copy"><p>STORIES<br>WITHOUT <span class="serif-word">borders.</span></p><button class="reel-button" type="button" data-film data-provider="{{ site.hero.reelProvider }}" data-id="{{ site.hero.reelId }}" data-hash="{{ site.hero.reelHash }}" data-title="{{ site.hero.reelTitle }}" data-note="{{ site.hero.reelNote }}"><span class="play-disc" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "play" %}</span><span>{{ site.hero.reelLabel }}<small>A glimpse into our world {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</small></span></button></div>
    <div class="film-bottomline"><span>From the red dirt road to the red carpet.</span><span>Sound on. World off.</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-foot"><p>Original voices.<br>Extraordinary possibilities.</p><p>Film. Television. Culture.<br>Made with the Tribe.</p><a href="#intro">Meet the tribe <span aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow-down" %}</span></a></div>
</section>
<section class="intro section-shell" id="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="section-label"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Who we are</span><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "asterisk" %}</span></div>
  <div class="intro-body"><h2 id="intro-title">A world of stories.<br><span class="muted">A different kind<br>of tribe.</span></h2><div class="intro-bottom"><p>We’re an independent TV & film content studio, bringing the voices of the Black diaspora to life. Connected by culture. Driven by curiosity. Here to tell the stories that stay with you.</p><a class="round-link" href="{{ '/studio/' | asset }}">Inside the tribe <span aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</span></a></div></div>
</section>
<section class="home-work section-shell" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section-topline"><span class="eyebrow">02 / A window into our world</span><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/work/' | asset }}">Explore the work {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div>
  <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="work-title">STORIES IN<br><span class="serif-word">the making.</span></h2><p>A few first frames.<br>So much more to come.</p></div>
  <div class="projects-grid">{% for project in projects %}{% if loop.index < 3 %}{% include 'project-card.njk' %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="work-footnote"><span class="status-dot"></span><p>A growing studio. An open-ended story. New projects will find their home here.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title"><div class="manifesto-track" aria-hidden="true">
  {% for copy in range(0, 2) %}
  <div class="marquee-group">
    {% for repeat in range(0, 16) %}<span class="marquee-item">NO SINGLE STORY. {% icon "asterisk" %}</span>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div><div class="manifesto-inner section-shell"><span class="eyebrow">Many roots. One tribe.</span><h2 id="manifesto-title">NOT HERE TO<br>FIT <span class="serif-word">in.</span><br>HERE TO <span class="outline-word">OPEN</span><br>THE FRAME<span class="orange">.</span></h2><div class="manifesto-bottom"><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "asterisk" %}</span><p>African. Brazilian. American. Caribbean. LatinX. European.<br>Different histories, connected futures.<br>Stories that cross oceans, generations and expectations.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="services-preview section-shell" aria-labelledby="services-title"><div class="section-topline"><span class="eyebrow">03 / What we bring to the frame</span><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/services/' | asset }}">Our capabilities {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div><h2 class="sr-only" id="services-title">Film, television and creative production services</h2>{% for service in services %}<a class="service-row" href="{{ '/services/' | asset }}#service-{{ service.number }}"><span class="eyebrow">{{ service.number }}</span><h3>{{ service.title }}</h3><p>{{ service.short }}</p><span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</span></a>{% endfor %}</section>
<section class="store-section section-shell" aria-labelledby="store-title">
  <div class="section-topline"><span class="eyebrow">04 / Beyond the screen</span><span class="eyebrow">Shop STP / For the culture</span></div>
  <div class="store-layout">
    <div class="store-copy"><h2 id="store-title">WEAR<br>THE <span class="serif-word">tribe.</span></h2><p>The story doesn’t end when the credits roll. Explore Shop STP, the Tribe’s world of streetwear and athleisure, with styles for adults and kids.</p><a class="round-link" href="{{ site.store }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Shop STP <span aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</span><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
    <a class="store-image" href="{{ site.store }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Explore the Shop STP store (opens in a new tab)"><img src="{{ '/assets/images/store-campaign.webp' | asset }}" alt="The Shop STP campaign: a group wearing the Tribe’s clothing with flags representing their cultures." width="1200" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="project-status">Culture, off screen.</span><span class="project-open" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
